      "before": "A cost in point accuracy was also observed when the deterministic BiLSTM-Attention architecture was converted to a probabilistic formulation. Across five seeds, mean RMSE increased from 0.2429~mm\\,h$^{-1}$ for BiLSTM-Attention to 0.2488~mm\\,h$^{-1}$ for Probabilistic BiLSTM-Attention, corresponding to an increase of approximately 2.5\\%. The probabilistic formulation therefore provided distributional information and near-nominal overall coverage, but did not improve point-forecast accuracy.",
      "after": "A cost in point accuracy was also observed when the deterministic BiLSTM-Attention architecture was converted to a probabilistic formulation. Across five seeds, mean RMSE increased from 0.2429~mm\\,h$^{-1}$ for BiLSTM-Attention to 0.2488~mm\\,h$^{-1}$ for Probabilistic BiLSTM-Attention, corresponding to an increase of approximately 2.5\\%. The probabilistic formulation therefore provided distributional information and near-nominal overall coverage \\textcolor{red}{of the nominal 95\\% interval}, but did not improve point-forecast accuracy.",
