      "anchor": "This result shows that near-nominal coverage over the complete test distribution",
      "before": "Prediction intervals widened as rainfall intensity increased, but the additional width was insufficient to maintain nominal coverage for the strongest events. This result shows that near-nominal coverage over the complete test distribution can conceal substantial undercoverage in a less frequent but meteorologically important regime. Reporting only overall coverage would therefore give an incomplete assessment of probabilistic forecast reliability.",
